          "text": "With Turuun on its back, it carries a branch of the Spindle Tree in its beak.",
          "locale": "en_US"
        },
        "fr_FR": {
          "text": "Turuun sur son dos, il porte dans son bec une branche du Fuseau.",
          "locale": "fr_FR"
        },
